# The reader's audiobooks: a book as one file and a book as a folder of
# parts, seeded by scripts/check-apps-sim.py. A tap opens the book; with no
# headphones connected the player switches Bluetooth on, finds the simulated
# pair, and plays, with its chapters, speed and sleep timer a tap away.
wait-for Audiobooks
expect The Quiet Shelf
expect Two Tones
expect M4B
expect 2 parts
expect-missing No audiobooks yet
clean
shot audiobook-library
tap The Quiet Shelf
wait-for Now playing
wait 1500
expect The Quiet Shelf
expect Ada Example
expect Chapter
expect 1 of 3
expect Simulated headphones
expect Pause
expect Chapters
expect Sleep
clean
shot audiobook-playing
tap Bluetooth audio output
wait-for Bluetooth audio
expect Simulated headphones
expect Connected
clean
shot audiobook-headphones
tap back
wait-for Now playing
tap Chapters
wait-for Chapters
expect One. A Familiar Light
expect Two. A Slow History
expect Three. A Quiet Future
clean
shot audiobook-chapters
tap Two. A Slow History
wait-for Now playing
expect 2 of 3
tap-id audio-speed
wait-for Speed
expect 1.0×
tap 1.5×
expect 1.5×
clean
shot audiobook-speed
tap back
wait-for Now playing
expect 1.5×
tap Sleep
wait-for Sleep timer
expect At the end of this chapter
clean
shot audiobook-sleep
tap In 30 minutes
wait-for Now playing
expect Pauses in 30 min
tap Pause
wait-for Play
clean
shot audiobook-paused
tap back
wait-for Audiobooks
expect Now playing
expect Paused
clean
shot audiobook-library-playing
tap Two Tones
wait-for Now playing
wait 1500
expect Two Tones
expect 1 of 2
clean
shot audiobook-folder-book
tap back
wait-for Audiobooks
# With no keys on the reader, Create names the exact command for each key,
# keeps the topic, and checks again rather than throwing the topic away.
tap Create
wait-for Your topic
tap Type any topic
type the moon
tap-id kb.enter
wait-for Add your keys
expect kobo secret set exa
expect kobo secret set openai
expect kobo secret set elevenlabs
expect Nothing has been spent
expect-missing Try another topic
clean
shot audiobook-keys
tap Check again
wait-for Add your keys
tap Edit topic
wait-for Your topic
expect the moon
clean
shot audiobook-topic-kept
